    intro: 'Flying Chit is ChitPlay\'s own endless 3D game. A folded paper chit has grown two little wings and is gliding through a classroom that never ends. You steer it in every direction with the stick. It slowly runs out of lift, and only flying through the golden bangles keeps it in the air. Ceiling fans and stacks of books knock the paper out of it. The room gets faster and busier the further you go.',
