    levels: [['Morning class', 'Only stacks of books get in the way.'], ['Fans on', 'Ceiling fans join the books.'], ['Swinging bangles', 'Some bangles swing from side to side. Aim where the bangle will be.'], ['Paper storm', 'The evening light comes in, paper flies through the air, and some books drift across too.'], ['Night class (level 5 and up)', 'The tube lights are on, and the fans bob up and down as well.'], ['Golden bangle', 'Every new level opens with a big golden bangle in the middle: 10 points and full lift.']],
