    faq: [['Does Flying Chit ever end?', 'No. The bangles get smaller and the room faster, so there is always a better score to chase.'], ['Can two people play on one screen?', 'Yes. Choose Single Phone: one player uses W A S D and the other the arrow keys, or each uses a gamepad.'], ['Is it like other flying games?', 'It is our own idea: you steer freely in 3D and keep the chit up by flying through bangles, instead of tapping to flap.']],
