    intro: 'Hoop Flick is a one-finger basketball game. The ball sits in a hoop on one side of the court and the next hoop waits on the other side. Pull back, aim and let go: the dotted line shows where the ball will fly. Drop it through the hoop and a new one appears on the other side. Higher, lower, and after a while the hoops start to move.',
